                <pb facs="0920" n="800" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg800"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Ambassador Meyer.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-12-13"><hi rendition="#italic">December 13,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Root instructs Mr. Meyer to ascertain whether necessary instructions for the
                    surrender of the Japanese prisoners held in Manchuria have been issued to the
                    Russian military authorities.)</p>
            </div>
